<td valign="top" width="229">
<p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><strong>acima de 25 apartamentos</strong></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" width="116">
<p align="center"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;">R$ 669,90</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;">&nbsp;<strong>COMERCIAIS E MISTOS</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><strong>(Salas e Lojas - Apartamentos e Lojas - Exclusivamente Lojas)</strong></span></p>
